// Import gateway: any template that calls a shared `func` (see typescript.common.functions.teso)
// should `import-file "typescript.imports"` once before its first `call`, rather than
// import-file-ing each function-definition file directly. `func` registration happens at parse
// time, so this must import before the calling template's `call` statements execute. As more
// shared function files are added to this blueprint, import them here so callers only ever
// need this one gateway.

: import-file "typescript.common.functions"
